<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Ibrawiyots</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ibrawiyots</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibrawi Ashuwots Maants Wosheets Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ibr.</para>
  <para style="mt">Ibrawi Ashuwots Maants Wosheets Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshan b́ guut'e mang wotts k'efo boats b́ bodtsosh bo imnetiyo k'azosh t'ints krstiyaniyotssha b́ tesh, guut'tsonwere Ibrawino eteefwotsitsi amantsuwotssh b́ kitsirwo Iyesus Krstos arkonat s'uwaatsi Ik'o b́ bek'shtso b́ wotoniye. Krstiyani hanots bo imnetiyon bo kup'itwok'o boon b́ kup'shiri, hanowere b́ k'alor arik wotts keez keewwotsi bogshdek't b́ kitsir.</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Bo ats bodts gond bek'man jangosh Nihosh arikon azazets wottso Iyesus dúre dúriko Ik' na'oniye, Ik' na'a b́ wottsotse Taari natotse teshts nebiyiwotsna, Musenat Woshetswotsiyere ayidek't boogke.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Iyesus nat taarotsi Kahaniyotsiyere ayidek't een wotts dúre dúri Kahani k'aab b́ wottsok'o Ik'o b́ tookon keewre.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Iyesus weeron amantso morrotse, k'ironat shatotse kashitwe, Iyesus Kahani naasho b́ wottsotse Ibrawino eteef ashuwots imnetiyo niwwotsnat gizi wosho c'ishok'o be'eyiru kasho arik b́ wotitwok'o k'alre.</para>
  <para style="ip">Han guut'tso Israe'el taarikiyotse shúúts een detsts ashuwots imnetiyo ariyok'o woshdek't (k'ot'ok 11) nababirwots bo imnetiyon bo kup'itwok'o b́ gawiyiri, mank'o k'ot'ok 12 nababirwots bo ááwwotsi Iyesusats woshde'r bo imnetiyon bo kup'itwok'onat kon naari gond bek'onat kic'o bo ats b́ bodal bok'amitwok'o b́ iziri, s'uwaatsnowere izonat ats kordek'i keewo bí imiyakon b́keewo need'ib́k'ri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo, Ik'o Krstosn b́ be'etsok'o 1:1-3</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos Wosh na'oniyere damb b́ wotok'o 1:4—2:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos Musenat Iyasuwiyere damb b́ wotok'o 3:1—4:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Jami abaatse Krstos Kahani b́ woto 4:14—7:28</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos taaro jamoniyere damb b́ woto 8:1—9:22</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos wosh woto bog b́wottsok'o 9:23—10:39</para>
  <para style="io1">Imneti bogo 11:1—12:29</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik' geneúsho 13:1-19</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpi Ik' k'ono 13:20-21</para>
  <para style="io1">B́ s'uwoko 13:22-25</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'o b́naay weeron noosh b́keewtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1"/>Ik'o yoots dúr ay weerindon, nebiyiwots weeron nonih nih wotssh ayoto keewtni b́ teshi, <verse eid="HEB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2"/>Andomó dúr s'uwanatse jam keewo b́ naatetwok'o b́ woshtson b́ naay weeron noosh keewre, dats jamonowere bíne bí'azi. <verse eid="HEB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3"/>Ik'i mango golr b́be'et bíyatsne, bí b́ doyon b́ s'eenon Ik'onton ike. B́ kúp' aap'on azeets jamo tep'dek't kurirwee, ash ashuwots morro b́ s'ayintsiyakon darotse Ik' kup'o k'ani aaromants beewtsere.<verse eid="HEB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Naay wotts Ik'o b́melakiyotsiyere ayidek't bog b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Dub. 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Sam. 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 17:13">1 Naash. 17:13</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe bísh imets shúútso melakiwotssh imets shúútsoniyere bogtso b́ wottsok'oon Ik'o naay, melakiwotsiyere ayidek't boge.<verse eid="HEB 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5"/>B́ jamon melakiwotsitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">«Neehe t naay neene, hambets taa neen shuure,»</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">Wee</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">«Taa bísh nih wotitwe, bíwere t naayi wotituwe»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:5">bí ettso konshe?<verse eid="HEB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 32:43">Iwi. 32:43</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o b́ naay k'aabo datsanats b́woshor</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">«Melaki jamwots bísh sagadone» etre.<verse eid="HEB 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 104:4">Dub. 104:4</ref> </char>
    </note> B́ melakiwots jangoshmó</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">«B́ melakiwotsi shayirwotsi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shayira: </char><char style="ft">Eto Griki mas'aafotse jongok'o woshefe etiru biitso detsfe. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:7">B́ gutswotsno taw laluwo woshitwee» bí eti.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Shayra: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eto b́melakitsi jongok'o woshitwe eta. </char></note><verse eid="HEB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8"/>B́ naayi jangoshmó,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">«Ik'ono! n naashi jooro dúre dúroshe b́ beeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:8">N mengsti gumbonu kááwon bín nk'eezit gumbee,<verse eid="HEB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8-9 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 45:6-7">Dub. 45:6-7</ref> </char>
    </note> Kááwu finono n shuni, morri gondo n shit'i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">Manatse tuutson Ik'o neen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:9">n tohwotsiyere bog gene'úwo neesh imet fuuto níats b́ fuuti» etfe.<verse eid="HEB 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10"/>Andowere aani, «Doonzono! nee shin shino datsu nk'oons'i,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">Darwotswere nkishi finnee,<verse eid="HEB 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11"/>Bo jametswere t'afitkne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Neemó beetune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">Bo jametswere tahok'o s'uwitkne<verse eid="HEB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 102:25-27">Dub. 102:25-27</ref> </char>
    </note> Shemok'o boon k'odetune,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Bowere tahok'o wonetúnee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">Nemó jam aawo woneratsnee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:12">N dúronwere s'uwo deshatse» bíeti<verse eid="HEB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o b́ melakiwotsitse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">«N balangarwotsi n tufi shirots t gedfetso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 1:13">t k'ano maantsan beewe» bí et konshe?<verse eid="HEB 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14"/>Bere, melaki jamwots kashit ash ashuwotssh finosh wosheets Ik'i guuts wotts shayirwotsi woteratsnowa?<verse eid="HEB 1:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2"/>
  <para style="s">Bodaatsts kasho korbodek'etwok'o b́ iztsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1"/>Eshe no shishts keewatse shortarr no dihirawok'o no shishits keew man jango sheengsh kordek'o noosh geyitwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2"/>Melakiwots weeron keewets aap'o arik wotwtsere, keewan finats jiitsrawonat keewmansho alerawo bísh wotit fayo daatsre, <verse eid="HEB 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3"/>Eshe, no kashts kash een wotts keewan no aatsnitka wotiyal aawk'oneya b́ shirotse keshosh nofaliti? Kashaanowere shin shin shishiyo dek'tuutso b́ tookon doonzoniye, bíyoke shishts ashuwotswere ar b́wottsok'o danirne. <verse eid="HEB 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4"/>Ik'onwere dabt milkiton, adits keewon, k'osh k'osh aditswotsi woshonat b́ shunok'o b́ imts shayiri S'ayin weeron bo gawts gawo kup'shre.<verse eid="HEB 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ash naaro kasho maantsan jishituwo Iyesusi b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5"/>Ik'o shinomaants weet datsu, no bjango nokeweyiru melakiwots bin boosh kewiratse <verse eid="HEB 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6"/>Dab́ S'ayin mas'aafwotsitse ikoke hank'o eteere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">«Nee bín n gawitwok'osh asho eebi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:6">Bo kis'o n detsetwok'o ash na'o eebi?<verse eid="HEB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7"/>Melakiwotsiyere muk'i ndashiyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:7">Mangonat údi zewdiyo b́ tookats n gedi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft">Yoots kishon guut'ets bits ik ikwots «N kishi finats bín nnaashiyi» etirwo dabfno. </char></note><verse eid="HEB 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8"/>Jam keewo bí ali shirots n woshi.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Jam keewo bí ali shirots b́ woshor, bí ali shirots woshraniyere b́ ooritso eegonwor aaliye. Ernmó and jam keewo b́ fa'ok'on bí ali shirotse b́ beyirwok'o andish b́borfetso be'afa'one. <verse eid="HEB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9"/>Andomó muk' aawush melakiwotsiyere muk'i dashan teshts k'iri gond bek'o b́daatstsosh mangonat údi zewdiyo kurdek'tso Iyesusi bek'etwone, bí Ik'i s'aaton no únetssh k'irre.<verse eid="HEB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10"/>Jam keewo bínat b́tookish azdek'ts Ik'o ay nana'úwotsi mangomants dowosh bo kashit weero jishitwo Iyesusi gond bek'on s'een b́ wotitwok'o b́woshi. <verse eid="HEB 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11"/>Ashuwotsi S'ayin woshitwonat b́weeron S'ayin wotts ashuwotswere nih iko nana'úwotsiye, manatse tuwtson Iyesus bonowere «T eshwotsiye» err s'eegosh jitseratse. <verse eid="HEB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12"/>Mansh S'ayin mas'aafwotsitse</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">«N shúútso tieeshwotssh keewitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 2:12">Ashuwots bokakwetsokee botaalotse dubon neen uditwe» etre.<verse eid="HEB 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:17-18">Isa. 8:17-18</ref> </char>
    </note> Mank'o</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">«Taa bí ats t imneitiyo juwitwe» etre,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:13">Ando aani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">«Hamb eshe taanat Ik'o taash b́imts nana'awotsn hanok noone» etre.<verse eid="HEB 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14"/>Mansh nana'anots meetsonat s'atson detsk ash bowottsotse Iyesuswere bokok'o ash b́wotiye, man b́ k'alwere b́ k'irtsatse tuutson k'iratse al detstso dablosi t'afiyoshee. <verse eid="HEB 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15"/>Mank'o k'ir shati jangosh bo dúr jamo guuts wotat kéweyat beyirwotsi aaniy kewdek'oshee. <verse eid="HEB 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16"/>Iyesus shuno, melakiwotsi b́ woterawo, Abraham naaro tep'oshee. <verse eid="HEB 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17"/>Mansh jam keewo bí eshwots kok'o woto bísh geyife b́teshi, mank'oon ashuwots morro orowa etosh Ik'osh finosh amanetsonat maarts kahni naashwotsatsi k'aabo b́wotiye. <verse eid="HEB 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18"/>Bí b́ tookosh fadeyat gondo b́bek'tsotse fadeyrwotsi tep'o falitwe.<verse eid="HEB 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus Museyiye bogo b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1"/>Darotse iti s'eegetsman kayitu wotts S'ayin amantsuwotso! no imneti kahni naashwots k'aab'onat Ik'o woshtso Iyesusats it aawo gerde'ere. <verse eid="HEB 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2"/>Muse Ik' maa jamatse amanek b́ teshtsok'o Iyesuswere bín naashits Ik'osh amaneke b́ teshi. <verse eid="HEB 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3"/>Maa agtso mooniyere bog mango b́detstsok'owa Iyesus Museyiyere bogts mango daatso bísh geyife. <verse eid="HEB 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4"/>Maa ik iko bín agts asho detsfe, jam keewo agtsonmó Ik'oniye. <verse eid="HEB 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5"/>Shinomaants keewu geyit keewosh gaw b́wotitwok'o Muse Ik'i maa jamatse amanek guutse b́teshi. <verse eid="HEB 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6"/>Krstosmó Ik'o maantse amanetso b́wot na'ok'o wotatniye, b́moonwere noone, b́ moo nowotitwere bí'ats no amanit keewonat arikon bín detsfone err bín noit'irwo nojangtso kup'ide desh nodek'oree.<verse eid="HEB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'i ashuwotssh boatso bo kotetwok'o keewetso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7-11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 95:7-11">Dub. 95:7-11</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe S'ayin shayiro bí'etirwok'on</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">«Hambets b́ k'ááro it shishor<verse eid="HEB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8"/>Worwotse taan it fador ti'ats it tuutsok'o</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">It nibo k'aztsi woshk'ayere,<verse eid="HEB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9"/>Hansh it nihots taan bo fadi taanton bo weed'eyi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">Hab natosh tk'altsonowere bobek'i» etfe Ik'oni.<verse eid="HEB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10"/>«Mansh man dúri s'ootwotsi t fayere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">‹Bonibo jam aawo b́sheliri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:10">T weerindonowere danatsne› ti eti.»<verse eid="HEB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11"/>Aaninwere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">« ‹Taa boosh ti imet kashdek'et beyok b́ jamon kindratsnee!› etaat</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:11">Fayat taarre.»<verse eid="HEB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12"/>Ti eshwotso! ititse beyat beyiru Ik'atse wokit gondonat amaneraw nibo b́ deshawok'o it atso korde'ere. <verse eid="HEB 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13"/>Eshe, ititse morron dasheyar b́ nibo k'aztsi b́ woshrawok'o «Hambetsa» et s'eegets aawo b́ befetsosh aaw aawon it atsatsewo izewere. <verse eid="HEB 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14"/>Shin shin no detstso no imnetiyo b́s'uwi aawo b́borfetsosh kup'de deshnodek'etka wotiyal Krstosnton bano kayitwotsi wotitwone.<verse eid="HEB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15"/>Manwere «Hambets b́ k'ááro it shishor</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 3:15">Weri gondi dúrmanor it k'altsinaaro it nibo k'aztsi woshk'ayere»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 3:15">et keewetsok'one.<verse eid="HEB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16"/>Wotowa bako b́ k'ááro boshishyakon gondat k'aztsmanots konotsne boteshi? Boon Muse jishdek't Gbs'itse dek' b́keshtswotsiwoshná? <verse eid="HEB 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17"/>Ik'o nibo hab nati s'eeno k'úúnit teshtswots konotsne? Morro finat boere boduuno worwotse dihit oortswotsiwoshna? <verse eid="HEB 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18"/>Eshe bísh aleratse eteets manotsi b́ wotiyalabako «T kashdek'i beyok kindratste» et boats b́ taartswots konotsne bo teshi? <verse eid="HEB 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19"/>Eshe kindo bomaaw amano bok'aztsatse tuutson b́ woto bek'rone.<verse eid="HEB 3:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1"/>Eshe, bí noosh b́ imetu kashdek'i beyokok kindosh noosh jangiyetso andoor b́besherafa'otse ititse konúwor kashdek'i beyok manok kindo b́ datsrawo b́ oorerawok'o nounetswor no'atso korde'one. <verse eid="HEB 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2"/>Sheeng doo shishi keewo bo boshishtsok'o noowere shishrone, ernmó bo boshishts aap'o amanat dek'o bok'aztsotse boosh eegor k'alratse. <verse eid="HEB 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 95:11">Dub. 95:11</ref> </char></note> B́ fino, shin datsu bí azor tuut s'uuk b́wotiyalor, «Taa boosh ti imet kashdek'okok b́jamon kindratsno etaat fayat taarre» bí ettsok'on andoor no bín amanirwots Ik'o noosh b́ imet kash dek'i beyokmanits kinditwone. <verse eid="HEB 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4"/>Beyok ikoke shawatl aaw jangosh, «Ik'o b́ fin jamáátse shawatl aawotse kashb́dek'i» ett guut'ere. <verse eid="HEB 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5"/>Mank'owere hanoke aani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:5">«Taa ti imts kashdek'okok b́ jamon kindratsnee» etfe.<verse eid="HEB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6"/>Doo shishiyets keewman shin shin shishtswots bísh alewo bok'aztsotse boosh imet kashdek'ok manok kindratsnee, b́wotefermó manits bokinditwok'owa eteets ik ikwots fa'ane. <verse eid="HEB 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7"/>Manwere shin shin eteetsok'on</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 4:7">«Hambets b́ k'ááro it shishor, it nibo k'aztso k'ayere.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:7">et Ik'o ay dúroniye il Dawit weeron b́ keewts aap'o «Hambetsa» ett s'eegts aawo k'osh aawo Ik'o beezree. <verse eid="HEB 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8"/>Iyasu boosh kashdek'o imre wotink'e, Ik'o ando aaniy «Hambetsa» err k'osh aawi jango keewrawnk'ee b́ teshi. <verse eid="HEB 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9"/>Eshe Ik'i ashuwotssh sanbat aawi kashdek'o oor fa'ee. <verse eid="HEB 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10"/>Ik'o b́ finatse kashb́dek'tsok'o mank'o Ik'o b́ imet kashdek'ok kinditwo b́ finatse kashdek'etwee. <verse eid="HEB 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11"/>Mansh konwor ashmanots ale k'azi areyo shoyde b́ dihrawok'o, Ik'oki kashdek'ok kindosh kup'de'oone.<verse eid="HEB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12"/>Ik'i aap'otso beyat beek wotat aaninwere finkee, git weeron shash detsts shikoniyere bogts shashe, kashonat shayiron, shas'onat jeemplon b́ galeefetsosh k'ut'itkee, nibi gitsotse ááshts hasabinat tewnon p'ec'de'er angshitkee <verse eid="HEB 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13"/>Ik'o shinatse ááshit azeetso eegonwor aaliye, bí ááwatse jam keewo sháánonat araats wotarr be'etke, noowere no aatet b́ shinaatsne.<verse eid="HEB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyesus kahniwotsatsi naash eeno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14"/>Eshe daarwotsits k'ut'beshat dambaan daromaants amkindts eeno kahni naashwotsatsi k'aabo nodetstsotse no imnetiyo kup'ide'er deshde'one, kahniwotsatsi naashi k'aabonwere Ik'i na'o Iyesusiye. <verse eid="HEB 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15"/>No nodetsts kahni naashwotsatsi k'aabo noo angi maawatse noosh maac' k'ew falitke, bí jamkeewon nokok'oye b́ fadeyi, wotowaere iku morro fineratse. <verse eid="HEB 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16"/>Eshe mhreto daatsr tep'o noosh b́geyit aawon s'aato nodaatsitwok'o s'aato b́daatsetwok Ik' be joorok ik shatalon t'iinone.<verse eid="HEB 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1"/>Kahniwotsatsi naash ik iko ashuwotsitse galeyar Ik'onton gonkit kis'aatse ashuwots shegro wotaarr mebonat wosho t'intsosh b́ naashiyefoni. <verse eid="HEB 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2"/>Bí b́tookon maawk b́detstsotse dartswotsnat sheeltswotsi maac' k'ewon s'iilo falitwe. <verse eid="HEB 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3"/>Bí b́ tokooshor maaw ash b́wottsatse tuutson morrosh oorowe eto daatsitwosho t'intso bín b́ geyit ashuwts s'uzsh b́woterawo b́ tookishorniyee. <verse eid="HEB 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Kesh. 28:1</ref> </char></note> Aronkok'o Ik'on s'eegetso b́ wotiyala bako konwor manghan b́tookon daatsratse.<verse eid="HEB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5"/>Krstoswor mank'o b́ tookon kahniwotsatse naash k'aabo woti mango de'atse, ernmó bí kahni naashi k'aab wotimango b́ datsi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">«Neehe t na'o neene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:5">Taa hambets neen shuure» etts Ik'okne.<verse eid="HEB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6"/>K'osh beyokoknowere Ik'o,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">«Melkes'edik' naashtsok'o</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 5:6">Neehe dúre dúrosh kahni neene» etfe.<verse eid="HEB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7"/>Ash wotat datsnatse b́ beyor, Iyesus k'irotse bín kashiyosh falit Ik'o maants een k'aaronat ay aac'uwo kuut'fetst Ik'o b́ k'oni, Ik'o b́shattsosh b́ k'ontso Ik'o b́ k'ebiye. <verse eid="HEB 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8"/>Ik'o naayi wotk'ay b́wotiyalor b́ bek'ts gond bek'atse aleyo danb́dek'i. <verse eid="HEB 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9"/>S'een wotat b́datseyakon aleyiru jamwots dúre dúron b́weeron kashitune. <verse eid="HEB 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10"/>Manwere Ik'o Melkes'edik' kahani naashok'o naashi k'aab woshdek't bín b́ naashiy.<verse eid="HEB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11"/>Keewan jangosh tkeewit keewo ay fa'ee, ernmó t'iwintsdek'osh falitk woto it k'aztsosh itsh daniyosh mange. <verse eid="HEB 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12"/>Andish b́ borfetsosh it danifwotsi woto faliyank'te b́ teshi, ernmó Ik'i aap'o shints dano itsh aani danitwo k'osh asho geyife, mansh mank'oon eshe itsh geyitwo ez goora bako kup' mishaliye, <verse eid="HEB 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 3:2">1 K'or. 3:2</ref> </char></note> Ez goor mec'ron beyiru jamo na'i marmat' b́ wottsotse sheeng keewonat gond keewon galdek'i dano dande'afa'e. <verse eid="HEB 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14"/>Kup' misho boosh b́geyitswotsmó sheegonat gondon galdek'i doy detsts ash een eenwotsiye.<verse eid="HEB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1"/>Eshe Krstos jangosh shin shin noosh imets danman shuutsomaants k'ayik'rar, s'een wottso maants beshone, k'irts finatse naandrone err Ik'o amnon neediyetsatsere tuur aani need'ik'ayone, <verse eid="HEB 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2"/>Ikinwere aatsots gupi jango, ashaats kish gedo, k'irotse tuwi jango, dúre dúr angshi jangosh wotit dano aani need'ik'ayone. <verse eid="HEB 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3"/>Doonzon tooh han k'alitwone.<verse eid="HEB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4"/>Bo imnetiyo k'az k'rts ashuwotsi Ik'o mandan aaniyosh faleratse. Ashaanots haniye shin shááno bek'rne, daratsnowere imeyiru imo shawshdek'rne, S'ayin shayratse kaydek'tswotsi woterne boteshi. <verse eid="HEB 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5"/>Ik' sheeng aap'onat weet dúri angon shawshdek'rne boteshi, <verse eid="HEB 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6"/>Jamaniyere il bo imnetiyatse shuutso maants boaanitka wotiyal bo botookon Ik'o Na'o aani jitetwotsnat ash shinatse bín bo ketitwotse boon naandre etomnadan aainyo faleratse.<verse eid="HEB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7"/>Ayoto bi'atsats oot'iru awsho ushiru datsu, bí'ats maay shookts ashuwotssh k'awnts detstso imiru datsu deero Ik'oke daatsitwaniye. <verse eid="HEB 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 3:17-18">Aze. 3:17-18</ref> </char></note> Angitsonat daaz angitson b bos'itka wotiyalmó k'awnts deshake bwotiti, kárn aawotsnowere c'asheetwane, b s'uwonwere tawon mis'e b́ wotiti.<verse eid="HEB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9"/>Shuneets eshwotso! dab mank'o tkeewiyalorni, it itkashit kasho dowet k'ants keewo it detsdek'tso arik b́wottsok'oniye no dankee. <verse eid="HEB 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10"/>Ik'o kááwon angshkee, mansh it fintsonat shinowere andowere s'ayinwotsi tep'osh b́shúútsosha etaat it kitsts shuno bateratse. <verse eid="HEB 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11"/>It unetswor jangdek'at it kotiru keewo desh itdek'fetsosh kup'arr b́ s'uwi aawo b́ borfetsosh it kup'o it kitsitwok'owe noteewniri, <verse eid="HEB 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12"/>No tewnirwere bo imnetiyonat k'amoon kup'arr boosh jangiyets keewo naatet ashuwotsi it aritwok'owa bako jik' mangwotsi it wotitwok'owaliye.<verse eid="HEB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o b́ jangits keewo arik b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13"/>Ik'o Abrahamsh b́ jangiwor bín b́ taaritwo b́ tookoniyere bogo k'osho konwor bí altsotse hank'o ett b́tookon b́ taari, <verse eid="HEB 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14"/>«Arikon neen deritwe, nnaronowere ayituwe.» <verse eid="HEB 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15"/>Abraham k'amoon kott bísh jangiyets keewo daatsre. <verse eid="HEB 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16"/>Ash ashuwots bo taaror boyere bogts shúútsone bo taarfoniye, bo keewonowere taaron kup'irr bo dagotse fa'a moosh jamonowere bo ishfooni. <verse eid="HEB 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17"/>Eshe mank'oon Ik'o b́ keewts keewo wonerak b́wottsok'o kitsosh geeyat b́ jangitso naatetwots b́ jangits taaro boosh b́ kup'iyi. <verse eid="HEB 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18"/>Ik'o hank'on wonerawotsnat bo jangosh b́ kooraw git keewwotsi, manotswere jangiyonat taaron noosh imre, git keewanotsatse tuutso no shinatse fa'o noosh b́ jangitso kup'shr desh dek'o nofalitwok'o, ááshoko daatsosh b́ maants wos'tswots no een angikup'o daatsitwone. <verse eid="HEB 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 16:2">Lew. 16:2</ref> </char></note> Jangeyirwan no kashosh shek'eraw kup' wotts mehlik'iya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mehlik'iya: </char><char style="ft">Eteetso markabo b́ beyoko b́ fakshawok'o woshirwoniye. </char></note> eteetsok'oyiye, Iyesusn no jangts jango Ik' meyitsi degoniyere beshar gitsots kinditwe. <verse eid="HEB 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20"/>Beyok manokowere kahni naasho Iyesus Melkes'edik'kok'o dúre dúrosh kahaniwotsats naashi k'aabok'o wotat no shegro shino kindre.<verse eid="HEB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kahniyo Melkes'edek'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1"/>Melkes'edek'hanwere Salem nugúsonat jamoniyere bog wotts Ik'osh kahniye b́ teshi, Melkes'edek'uwere Abraham naash naashwotsi da'at bí aanor weerindatse bín gonkat b́deeri. <verse eid="HEB 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2"/>Abrahamwere b́detsts jamotse tatslo kishdek't bísh b́ ími, Melkes'edek' shúútsi bits shintso «kááw Nugúsa» etee. Bíwere «Salem Nugúsee» han etonu «Jeeni Nugúsa» etee. <verse eid="HEB 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3"/>Melkes'edik' daneets nihonat indun b́detstsok'o guut'etsotse daneets shuweyi s'ap'o deshatse, b́ dúri tuwokonat b́ kashi geenzo s'uwoko deshatse, Melkes'edik'an Ik'o Naaykok'o ariyetso dúre dúrosh kahni wotatniye b́beeyi.<verse eid="HEB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4"/>Ashaan aawk'o een b́wottsok'o s'iilere, shints nihwotssh nih wottso Abraham woor dab kes'oke biik'b́dots keewatse tatslo kishdek'tniye b́ imiye. <verse eid="HEB 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 18:21">Taaw. 18:21</ref> </char></note> Kahni finats beezeyiru Lewi naarotse ash ashuwotsitse, Abraham naaratse, man etonwere bo eshwotsatse tatslo bodek'etwok'o nemo azazere. <verse eid="HEB 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6"/>Melkes'edik'man dab Lewiwwots naar woto b́ k'azalor Abrahamoke tatslo dek're, bísh jangiyetso Abrahamnor derree. <verse eid="HEB 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7"/>Muk'efo biyere eeno kishatse deero b́ dek'etwok'owo aato deshatse. <verse eid="HEB 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8"/>Tatsl dek'irwots ik weeron k'irtke wotkne, k'oshweeronmó tatsl dek'irwo kashon b́ beetwok'o bísh gawetso Melkes'edik'iye. <verse eid="HEB 7:8"/><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9-10"/>Melkes'edek' Abrahamnton b́gonkeyor Lewi b́nih Abrahamatse b́ shwerafa'otse tatsl dek'o bísh b́geyitso Lewi b́ tookosh Abraham weeron tatslo dashre etee.<verse eid="HEB 7:9-10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11"/>Ashuwotssh nemo ime Lewi kahaniyo weerone, Lewawino etefanoots kahni weeran s'een woto daatsere wotink'ere Aron kahny naasho b́woterawon Melkes'edik' naash detstso k'osh kahniyo b́woo geyirawnk'ee b́teshi, <verse eid="HEB 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12"/>kahani fino b́ woneewor nemonwere bínton towaar wonewo geyife. <verse eid="HEB 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13"/>Jaman b́ jangosh keewets kahniyo k'osh naare, han naarotse konwor wosht'intseyiru t'arap'ezoke t'int fintso aaliye. <verse eid="HEB 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14"/>No doonz Yhud naar b́ wottsok'o daneke, b́ wotefere Muse kahniwots jango b́ keewor Yhud naaro s'iilt b́ keewtso eegor aaliye.<verse eid="HEB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Krstos Melkes'edik'k'o kahni b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15"/>Keewan ayide sháánr b́datsetiye k'osho Melkes'edik'kok'o kahniyo b́ tuworee, <verse eid="HEB 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16"/>Bí kahni woti naasho b́ dek', b́kash genzi s'uwoko deshawona bako naaron waats nemonaliye. <verse eid="HEB 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Dub. 110:4</ref> </char></note> «Melkes'edik' kahani b́wottsok'o nee dúre dúrosh kahni neene» et bísh gawere. <verse eid="HEB 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18"/>Shin eteets tzaziyo nef wotat k'awntsalk b́ wottsotse bín shaark'reree. <verse eid="HEB 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19"/>Muse nemon ik keewonwor s'een wotofalratse, andmó Ik'ok b́ weeron t'inosh nofalitwo k'antso nojángtso noosh imere.<verse eid="HEB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20"/>Haniyere okoon kahniyan Ik'i taaralon wotkaliyee, haniyere shino kahni wottsmanoots taaralone bowoti. <verse eid="HEB 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Dub. 110:4</ref> </char></note> Iyesusmó kahni b́wot Ik'o b́ taartsotsnee, manwere</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">«Doonzo ‹Neehe dúre dúrosh kahni neene› ett taarre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 7:21">bíasabiyo woneratse» ett b́ jango keewetsok'one.<verse eid="HEB 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22"/>Taarmanatse tuutson Iyesus taaron kindeets k'antsosh wusho wotere.<verse eid="HEB 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23"/>K'iratse tuutson kahni iko b́wonerawon b́finatse beyo b́falrawotse shints kahniwots bo taawo aye b́teshi, <verse eid="HEB 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24"/>Iyesusmó dúre dúrosh beyirwo b́ wottsotse b́ khnetiyo woneratse. <verse eid="HEB 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25"/>Mansh bo jangosh Ik'o k'onosh dúre dúrosh beyar beetwo wotar b́betwotse b́weeron Ik'o maants weetu jamwotsi b́ jamon kashiyosh falitwe. <verse eid="HEB 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26"/>Hank'o S'ayino, ik kiimo bíyatse aaltso, s'ayino, morretswotsitse gaaletso, dari aboniyere eents kahniwotsatse naashi k'aabo noosh geyife. <verse eid="HEB 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 9:7">Lew. 9:7</ref> </char></note> Bí kahni k'oshwotskok'o shino b́ took morrosh, ilowere ash ash morrosh aaw aawon wosho t'intso bísh geyiratse, b́ tooko wosh woshdek't b́ t'intsor han aaniy b́geyirawok'on ishbazree. <verse eid="HEB 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28"/>Nemo kahniy naash woshdek't b́ naashitswots maaw ashuwotsiye, nemoniyere ili waatso taaron keweetsonmó dúre dúrosh s'een wottso Ik'o naayi naashire.<verse eid="HEB 7:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8"/>
  <para style="s">Iyesus handr taaron kahni naasho b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe bojangatse nokeweyiru keewwotsitse bog keewo haniye, darotse Ik' eeno jori k'ani aaromantse beyirwo hank'o kaheniyi naash k'aabo detsfone. <verse eid="HEB 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2"/>Bí b́ finit S'ayin beyok arik wotts k'ewoko dunkaniyotse, dunkaniyan b́ k'oons'eyiye ash kishon b́woterawon doonzo kishonee. <verse eid="HEB 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3"/>Kahni naasho ik ikon b́naashiye imonat woshon b́t'intsitwok'owe, mansh kahniyanwere b́t'intsitwo ik keewo detso bísh geyife. <verse eid="HEB 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4"/>Nemok'on Ik'osh imetso t'intsit kahniwots bofa'otse bí datsatsa wotink'ere kahniyo woterawnk'e b́teshi, <verse eid="HEB 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5"/>Kahniyanots bo finirwo dunkani darotse fa'aman ariyonat b́ s'ilal mec'ree, man b́wotwere Muse gofu bí agoor, Ik'o «Guri abaatse neesh b́ be'etsok'on jam keewo t'iwintson finowe» ett bísh b́ keewtsok'onee. <verse eid="HEB 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6"/>Andmó Iyesus dag taalotse manitso b́ wotts taaro beshts nat taaratse bogonat k'ants jangiyetswotsats need'iyetso b́ wottsotse bísh imets fino boge.<verse eid="HEB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7"/>Shin kindeets taaro shapo deshawo wotarr b́datseyink'ere gitlo taareyo geyirawnk'ee b́teshi. <verse eid="HEB 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8"/>Ik'o bí ash ashaatse shapo b́beyo kitsfetst hank'o etfe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">«Hamb, Israe'el ash ashuwotsnat Yihud ash ashuwotsnton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:8">Handron notaaret aawo weetwe» etfe Doonzoni.<verse eid="HEB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9"/>Taaranwere Gbs'itse bokisho detsdek'at boon tkishoor bo nihotsnton t taaretsok'oyiyaliye, bo taanton bo taaretsats bo kup'erawotse taawere boon aatsni tk'ri etfe Doonzoni.<verse eid="HEB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10"/>«Eshe, haniyhakon Israe'el dats ash ashonton</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">T taaret taaro hank'owiye etfe Doonzoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Taa tnemone bo tookots beezitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">bo nibotsowere guut'etwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Bo Ik'onowere wotitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:10">Bowere tiashwotsi wotitune.<verse eid="HEB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11"/>‹Doonzo dande'e› err k'osh ashosh wotowa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">bí eshwsh daniyitwo konwor beeratsye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Muk'aatse tuur eenok b́borfetso jametso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:11">taan danetwe,<verse eid="HEB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12"/>Bonandosh oorowe eteetwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 8:12">Bomorronowere haniyak boats taawratse.»<verse eid="HEB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13"/>Haniyak «Handr taara» bí etor shints taarman nat woshre etee, mansh nat jamo b́ t'afit aawo t'iinwtsere.<verse eid="HEB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9"/>
  <para style="s">Datsatsi Ik' k'oni mootsi finonat daritstson</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1"/>Shin taarets, Ik' ik'iyi fini niwonat datsatsi Ik' Ik'iiyef beyoko detsfe b́teshi <verse eid="HEB 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2"/>Git k'aat'wotsi detsts dunkaniyu k'andek'rane b́teshi. C'eeshi gedokunat, woshi tusho bíyats b́beef t'arap'ez detsts shints maa kayu «S'ayinoki» eteefuni b teshi. <verse eid="HEB 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3"/>Gitl magarajiwoniyere jiik'o maantse gitsitsi kayu «S'aynat S'ayintsu» eteefuni. <verse eid="HEB 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4"/>Dunkani kay gitsitsts hanitse awntson dozets it'ano bíyats s'uwiyeyiru t'arap'ezonat, awntson futets taari taboto biitse fa'ebte b́tesh, taari tabotaniitse mano biitse detsts awntsi mosobiynu, atáát teshts Aron gumbu, nem tatswotsi bí'ats guut'ets gashets shútswots fa'ano boteshi. <verse eid="HEB 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5"/>Taabotatse fa'a morr t'afitwo bo bangon ipiru mangts Kirubeliwots fa'ano boteshi, ernmó jam keewanots jango and ik ikon keewo falratsonee.<verse eid="HEB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="NUM 18:2-6">Taaw. 18:2-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Hank'on jam keewo k'an b́wtsiyakon kahniwots bo fino s'eentsosh dunkany shintsi kayuts uni aawo kinditune. <verse eid="HEB 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7"/>Gitl gitsitsi k'at'uts kinditwonmó kahniwotsats naashi k'aabo s'uziye, b́ kinditwere worwototse ik aaw s'uziye, bíye b́ took jangonat ash asho dáron b́fiints morrosh b́ t'intsit s'atso desh b́de'aawo kindratse. <verse eid="HEB 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8"/>Dunkani k'at' shintsu b́ befetsosh S'ayinat S'aynu maants daamet weerindo andoor k'esheerafa'a b́wottsok'owo S'ayin shayiro hank'one b́ kitsiri. <verse eid="HEB 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9"/>Hanwere and dúro artsoniyee, mank'oon t'iniru imonat woshon t'intsiru asho nibo S'ayintsosh falatsne, <verse eid="HEB 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10"/>Keewanots handrit aawo b́waafetsosh finats jints úratsi niwwotsiye, boowere móónat úshi jangosh k'osh k'osh mashdek'osh beezets niwwots s'uzsh k'aleknee.<verse eid="HEB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11"/>Ernmó Krstos and beyiru sheeng keewwotssh kahniwotsatsi naashi k'aabo wotat be'ere, bí b́kindts dunkaniyu een wotat s'eenuniyee, goofhaan ash kishon finerawnat azeetsaniitsk wotkiyaliye, <verse eid="HEB 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12"/>S'aynat S'ayinuts iknoto b́ s'atso dek't aani iwisherawok'on b́ kindi bako, eeyishikonat máánzi s'atso dek't kindratse, mank'oon dúre dúrosh noon woritwo noosh b́ daatsiyi. <verse eid="HEB 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13"/>Eeyishwotsna, manz wur s'atsonat woshosh mis'ts miinzigelu tulo kiimts ashuwotsats fakewoor meets kimatse boon mayde b́ S'ayintsitka wotiyal, <verse eid="HEB 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14"/>Dúre dúri shayri weeron b́tooko kiimo bíatse aalts wosho woshdek't Ik'osh t'intstso Krstos s'atso beyat beyiru Ik'osh finosh no nibo k'irts finotse aawk'owe iki bogo b́ s'ayintsiti k'úna!<verse eid="HEB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15"/>Ekeewots bos'eege Ik'o jangit dúre dúrosh b́ imts rstiyo bodek'etwok'o Krstos handr taari dagotse manitwo wotere, man b́wotwere ash ashuwotsi shin taari shirots wotde bofints morrotse kashiyosh b́k'irtsoshe.<verse eid="HEB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16"/>Jeshu kasho b́ beewor jeshu kashirwo b́ k'iro dandek'o geyife, <verse eid="HEB 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17"/>Jeshuman arikon finats b́ jinet jeshu kashirman b́ k'irihakee, jeshu kashirwo kashon b́ befetsoshmó jeshuman fineratse. <verse eid="HEB 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18"/>Mank'o b́wottsotse shints taaronúwor dab s'atsalon finats jinatse.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Taara: </char><char style="ft">Grriki mas'aafotse taaronat eekon ikne. </char></note> <verse eid="HEB 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19"/>Shin shin Muse b́ ímts nemotse fa'a tzaziwotsi ash jamosh keewre, maniyere hakon máánzonat eyishi s'atso aatsonton dek't nemi mas'aafonat ash jamono, hisop'i mit maaronat mereeri biri s'iron b́faki, <verse eid="HEB 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20"/>B́ fakwere «Ik'o itsh b́ azazts taaritsi s'atso haniye.» ettniye. <verse eid="HEB 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 8:15">Lew. 8:15</ref> </char></note> Mank'o dunkaniwotsnat, boon kis'kesheyiru k'ac' jamats s'atso fakeree. <verse eid="HEB 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 17:11">Lew. 17:11</ref> </char></note> Arikonoor Muse nemok'on muk' keewwotsiyere okoon jam keewo s'atsone b́ S'ayineti, s'atso b́kuud'erawonowere morratse S'ayino daatseratse.<verse eid="HEB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos morro t'afiyosh wosh b́woto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23"/>Eshe darotsi keew hanotsi ariyets wotts jamanots hannk'o niwron s'ayino boosh geyitwe b́teshi, darotsik wotts keewwotswor botookon haniyere bogts woshon s'ayino boosh geyife. <verse eid="HEB 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24"/>Krstos arik «Ik' maa S'ayinun» ariyeek wottsunat ash kishon finets S'ayinu beyokuk kindratse, bí b́tookon and nojangosh Ik'o shinatse be'ewosh darots kindre. <verse eid="HEB 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25"/>Ayhudi kahniwotsats naashi k'aabo b́ tooki s'ats woterawo s'atso dek't worwot worwoton S'aynat S'ayintsuts b́kindfoni, Krstosmó b́ tooko ayoto woshok'o k'alde t'intsosh kindratse. <verse eid="HEB 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26"/>Mank'o b́wotink'ere datso bíazeewortson ayoto gond bek'o dek'osh bísh geyiyank'ee b́teshi, and dúri s'uwaatse morro k'aaúbazosh b́ tooko wosho woshdek't iknoto iwishirawok'on be'ere. <verse eid="HEB 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27"/>Ashosh iknoto k'iro beezk'rere, k'ironiyere okonowere bí ats angshetwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa. 53:12</ref></char></note> Mank'owere Krstos aywots morro k'aaúbazosh iknoto shukeere, aaninwere morro kurosh b́woterawo bín kotirwotsi kashiwosh gitlo be'etwe.<verse eid="HEB 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1"/>Nemo shinomaantsi weyiru sheeng keew ara (c'isha) b́ teshi bako b́tookon arikeewaliye b́teshi, mansh worwot worwoton jam aawo bo shukeet woshwotsi de'er Ik'ok t'iinet ashuwots s'een woshosh b́jamon falratse. <verse eid="HEB 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2"/>Nemo boon s'ayintsk'ro falituwe wotink'ere Ik'o mangiyosh t'iinet ashuwots jango, morrotse bos'ayintsotsnat morr deshawok'on bogitsotse boosh b́danetwotse wosh t'intso k'ayk'riyank'onee b́teshi. <verse eid="HEB 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3"/>Woshmanotsmó dúre dúr morro bín bogaawitwotsiye. <verse eid="HEB 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4"/>Minz wurwotsnat eyishuwots s'atso morro k'aaúbazo falratse.<verse eid="HEB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:5-7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 40:6-8">Dub. 40:6-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Mansh Krstos datsumaanats b́ woor hank'o etre,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">«Woshonat imo geeratsne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:5">Atsonmó taash k'anirnee,<verse eid="HEB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6"/>Mis'et woshonat</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">Morr t'afiyosh shukeet woshon</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:6">Geneeúweratsne,<verse eid="HEB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7"/>Taa manoor,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">‹Ik'o Izar Izewero! mas'aafotse t jangosh guut'etsok'on</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:7">ni alo s'eentsosh waare› » ti eti.<verse eid="HEB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8"/>Bíwere shin ekeewots nemok'on kúúh keweekno bowotiyalor «Woshonat imon, mis'et woshonat morri k'awntso oorowe etosh shukeyiru wosho geeratsne, manotsnowere gene'úweratsne» bí eti, <verse eid="HEB 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9"/>Aaninwere, «Hamb, taa n shuntso s'eentsosh waare» bíeti, mank'oon gitlo man naari wosho beyok b́shato shegrshosh shintsi naar wotts wosho k'aaúbazre. <verse eid="HEB 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10"/>Mannowere «n shuna» etiru keewok'on Iyesus Krstos meetson iknoto aaniy b́ iwishirawok'on wosho wotat b́ t'intsotse s'ayinronee.<verse eid="HEB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11"/>Kahniyo ik ikon morro k'aaúbazo falraw woshmanotsi uni aawo t'intsfetst aaw aawo need'dek'tni b́finefoni. <verse eid="HEB 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12"/>Krstosmó jam aawosh wotit wosh ikman b́t'intsiyakon Ik'o niho k'aniaaromaants beewtsere. <verse eid="HEB 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13"/>Haniyakon bín shit'irwots bí ali shirots bowotefetsoshe b́kotiri, <verse eid="HEB 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14"/>Manb́wotwere S'ayintsmanotsnowere wosh ikatse tuutson dúre dúrosh s'eenwotsi b́woshtsotsnee.<verse eid="HEB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15"/>S'ayin shayironwere keewan jango noosh gawitwe, shin shinonowere,<verse eid="HEB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16"/>«Aawu manotsiyere il</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Bonton t taaret taaro haniye etfe doonzoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">T nemone it nibots beezitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:16">bo tookotsowere guut'etuwe.»<verse eid="HEB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17"/>Manats dabtnwere «Bo fints gond finonat morron</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:17">haniyere hakon gawratse» etfe.<verse eid="HEB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18"/>Mansha morr jamo oorowe etehakon morr s'ayintsosh t'intset wosho haniyere okoon t'intso geyiratse.<verse eid="HEB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ik'o maants t'ino geyitk b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19"/>Eshnee, ti eshwotso! Iyesus s'atsatse tuutsona jamoniyere bogts S'ayints Ik' moots kindosh nonfaliyt agito daatsdek'rone, <verse eid="HEB 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20"/>Nokinditwere b́ magarajiyon, etonwere b́ meetsatse tuutson noosh b́ k'eshts handronat kashomaants jiishts weerone. <verse eid="HEB 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21"/>Ik'i mootse al detsts kahni eeno detsfone. <verse eid="HEB 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 8:30">Lew. 8:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Hzk'. 36:25</ref> </char></note> Mansh eshe nogitso gond gawoniyere b́ s'ayinetwok'o nonibats fakde'er, no atsonowere s'ayin aatson mashde'er, nib s'ayinonat arik wotts imnetiyo deshde'er Ik'ok t'iinone. <verse eid="HEB 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23"/>Jangiyets keewo noosh imtso amanek b́ wottsotse jangat nokeewirwo jangiyetsatse hake baka noerawon kup'shde deshde'one. <verse eid="HEB 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24"/>Shunoonat sheeng keewon k'ande'er nobetwok'o iko ikosh gawiwe, <verse eid="HEB 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25"/>jam aawo gonkeyaar no atsatsewo kup'shwoone bako, ik ikwots bok'alfok'o nokakwewo k'azk'ayonee, ikinwor, doonzo weyi aawo b́ karntsok'o gawde'e iki bogshde'er k'aluworee.<verse eid="HEB 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26"/>Ariko dan nodek'iyakon danfetsr morro nofiniyal haniyere okoon morrosh t'iinet wosho b́jamon aaliye. <verse eid="HEB 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 26:11">Isa. 26:11</ref> </char></note> And ooritwonmó shinomaantsi wotitwo shatits angshonat k'efirwotsi mitsit shatits taawoniye. <verse eid="HEB 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Iwi. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref> </char></note> Muse gedts nemó titsetwats, git ash wee keez ashuwots bíats bogawitka wotiyal maac' k'ewalo b́k'iritwok'o wotowe. <verse eid="HEB 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kesh. 24:8</ref> </char></note> Eshe, Ik'o naayi gac'tso, bín b́s'ayints taaron waats s'atso k'awntsalk woshtso, s'aati shayiro c'ashtso, aawk'o bog fayeek'úna bísh wotiti arefa itsha? <verse eid="HEB 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 32:35-36">Iwi. 32:35-36</ref> </char></note> «Weer weersho tikee, taaye wotit k'awntso dashetwe» ettso koni b́wottsok'o danfone, mank'o, «Doonzo bí ashuwotsats angshitwe». <verse eid="HEB 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31"/>Beyat beyiru Ik'o kishats diho ayide'er shatitkee.<verse eid="HEB 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32"/>Shááno itsh b́shaniyakon ay gondo bek'aat bojangosh it k'amts manotsi bali aawwotsi gawwore. <verse eid="HEB 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33"/>K'atsoor ash shinatse c'asheertee, gondonowere bek'rte, k'atsoorowere man naari gondbek'o boats b́bodts ashuwotsnton tooh itwottsotse gondo bek'rte. <verse eid="HEB 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34"/>It tipetswotssh maac'o k'ewerte, k'antsonat uni aawosh beet gaalo itdetstsok'o itdantsosh it detstso itatse dek'eworowere k'amdek'at man genee'uwon dek'rtee. <verse eid="HEB 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35"/>Eshe een shilmatiyo bín itdaatsitwo bíyats it amantsman juuk'ayere. <verse eid="HEB 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36"/>Ik'i ettso s'eentsr Ik'o itsh imosh b́ taarts keewo daatsosh k'amar kordek'o itsh geyife. <verse eid="HEB 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37"/>Mansh eshe, hank'o ett guut'ere,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">«Weetuman muk' gizewoniyere okoon weetwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:37">ja'aratse,<verse eid="HEB 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:37-38 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="HEB 2:3-4">Ibr. 2:3-4</ref> </char>
    </note> Tik wottso kááw ashonmó amanon kasho daatsituwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 10:38">Shuutso maants bí aaniyalmó taa bíatse tuutson,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">Geneeúweratse.»<verse eid="HEB 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39"/>Noomó amanar kash datsituwots jirwots noona bako shuuts aanar t'afitwots jirwots noonaliye.<verse eid="HEB 10:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11"/>
  <para style="s">Imnetiyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1"/>Amana etoni, jangat koteyiru keewo «Ee arikon wotitwe» err dek'ee, ááwosh be'eraw keewonowere b́ be'eyirwok'o woshde'er taawe. <verse eid="HEB 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2"/>Shin ashuwotsi udeyiye bo amantsatse tuutsone.<verse eid="HEB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 1:1">Aze. 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 33:6-9">Dub. 33:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:3">Yoh. 1:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Datso bí azee Ik'on b́ wottsok'o t'iwintsdek'o nofalit amanone. Mansh be'eyiru keew jamo be'erawatse b́ finootsk'owo danfone.<verse eid="HEB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 4:3-10">Aze. 4:3-10</ref> </char>
    </note> Abeel k'aayeliyere bogts wosho Ik'osh b́ t'ints b́ amantsoshe, Ik'o Abeel imtso b́ dek'or Abeel b́ imnetiyon kááw b́ wotok'o gawere, Abeel b́ k'iriyaloru b́ imnetiyon andoor keewirwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 5:21-24">Aze. 5:21-24</ref> </char>
    </note> Henok k'iro bi'ats b́borawok'o dambaan bín k'aaúdek'e b́ imnetiyoshe, Ik'o bín k'aaúb́dek'tsotse daatseratse, bín k'aaúdek'ewoniyere shinoor Ik'o b́gene'úshtsok'o bísh gawere. <verse eid="HEB 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6"/>Amanerawon Ik'i geneúsho faleratse, Ik'ok t'iinet asho Ik'o b́beyonat bín geyiru ashuwotsshowe k'awntso bimetwok'o amano bísh geyitwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Aze. 22:1-14</ref> </char>
    </note> Noh manoori ááwon be'eraw keewwotsatse atso korbodek'etuwok'o Ik'o b́ keewor Ik'o shatt b́ meyitsi ashuwotsi woriyosh markabo b́ dooz b́ amantsoshe, Noh imnetiyonowere datso morretsi bwoto dant datswats bí angshi, Nohuwere amanon daatset kááw woto b́ naati.<verse eid="HEB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 12:1-5">Aze. 12:1-5</ref> </char>
    </note> Abraham keer, bísh risti woshde'er b́ dek'et beyokok bí ametuwok'o bín s'eegeyor bí ametuwoko dab b́dariyalor amoosh bíazaze amanatniye. <verse eid="HEB 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 35:27">Aze. 35:27</ref> </char></note> Jangiyets keewo bínton naatetwotsi wottswots Yisak'nat Yak'obnton jangiyets datswatse ash datsi ash wotat gofootse b́bee imnetiyone. <verse eid="HEB 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10"/>Man b́k'alwere b need'oko kup' wottsu, Ik'o ay dúrosh gaw dek't bí agts kitu b́ kotirwotsnee.<verse eid="HEB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 18:11-14">Aze. 18:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:2">21:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Sarash jangits Ik'o amanek b́wottsok'o bdantsotse na'a shuwo bish beshtsunat Abraham ayidek't gawero b́wotyalor na'o bodaatsitwok'o ango bdaats imnetiyone. <verse eid="HEB 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Aze. 15:5</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22:17</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:12">32:12</ref> </char></note> Mansh Abraham k'irts ashok'o taawets ikatse daritsi k'eenok'onat aatsi gúúratsi shiyok'o taaweraw naaro b́datseyi.<verse eid="HEB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 23:4">Aze. 23:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:15">1 Zen. 29:15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Dub. 39:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Jametsanots boamantsok'one bok'iri, Ik'o boosh imosh b́ jangits keew jamo daatsratsne, ernmó wokoon s'iilt bo daatsdek'tsok'o woshdek't genee'uwon k'aaúbodek'i. Datsatsnowere ibonat ash datsi ashok'o bowotonowere t'iwints bodek'i. <verse eid="HEB 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14"/>Hank'o keewiru ashuwots bo took datso wottso kotiruwotskok'owa shanidek't bokitsiri. <verse eid="HEB 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15"/>Bítse bokeshts datsman gawrno wotink'ere b́maants aniyank'nee b́ teshi. <verse eid="HEB 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16"/>Andmó iki bogtso, darotse fa'a datso miraac'irunee, mansh Ik'o kito boosh b́ k'anitsotse «Noko Izar Izeweri» err bín bos'eegal bín jitsiratse.<verse eid="HEB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Aze. 22:1-14</ref> </char>
    </note> Abrahami fadewor Yisahak'i woshok'o woshdek't b́ t'ints imnetiyone, bísh jangiyets aap'o dek'tso Abraham b́ na'a iks'uzo shukoshe b́teshi, <verse eid="HEB 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Aze. 21:12</ref> </char></note> Beree Ik'o, «Yisak'n n naaro neesh s'eegetwe» ettniye b́teshi.<verse eid="HEB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19"/>Ik'o k'irotse tuuzo b́ falituwok'o Abraham bí amantsosh arikon k'irotse b́ tuutsok'o woshdek't Yisahak'i aaniy daatsb́dek'i.<verse eid="HEB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20"/>Yisak' shinomaants wotit keewo gawudek't Yak'obnat Esawn imnetiyone b́ deeri.<verse eid="HEB 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 47:31-48:20">Aze. 47:31—48:20</ref> </char>
    </note> Yak'ob k'irosh b́ t'intsok'on Yosef nana'úwotsi ik ikon deert b́ gumbi c'uushats te'edek't Ik'osh b́sagad imnetiyone.<verse eid="HEB 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Aze. 50:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 13:19">Kesh. 13:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Yosef k'irob́t'intsok'on Isra'el ashuwots Gbs'itse bokeshetwok'o b́ keew b́ mak'tsonowere awuk'o bok'alitwok'o boosh tzaziyo bí'im amanatniye.<verse eid="HEB 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kesh. 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 1:22">1:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Muse b́ shweetsok'on b́ indunat b́ nihn azsheeng b́ woto bobek'tsosh Nugúso tzaziyo bosharawo keez shashosh boáats imnetiyone.<verse eid="HEB 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:10-12">Kesh. 2:10-12</ref> </char>
    </note> Musewor bí eeniyakon «Fer'on na'i na'a» err s'eegeyo b́k'az imnetiyone. <verse eid="HEB 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25"/>Mansha manorush morron daatset genee'oniyere Ik'i ashuwotsnton gondbek'o daatso b́ marat'i. <verse eid="HEB 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26"/>Shino maantsowere b́ daatsit k'awntso b́ bek'tsotse Gbs' galoniyere Krstos jangosh gac'eyo bog b́ wottsok'o gaw b́dek'i.<verse eid="HEB 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:15">Kesh. 2:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Nugúso fayonowere b́sharawo Gbs'itse b́ kesh amanone, ááwon bek'erawo Izar Izewernowere b́ bek'tsok'o wosht b́ weeratse b́ kúp'i. <verse eid="HEB 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12:21-30">Kesh. 12:21-30</ref> </char></note> K'aab na'o úd'osh azazets Ik'i melakiyo Israe'el dats ashuwots k'aab na'o b́ úd'rawok'owa ett Fazigonat s'ats faki nemo b́k'al imnetiyone.<verse eid="HEB 11:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:21-31">Kesh. 14:21-31</ref> </char>
    </note> Israe'el dats ashuwots dats shuuk'atse kimírwok'o aats k'ar birotse bokim bo amnanoshe, Gbs' ashuwotsmó mank'o k'alosh botuwor bo jametsuwots aats limniye bowtsi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30"/>Israe'el ashuwots Iyariko shútsi kas'o imnetiyon shawat aawo boguurtsosh shútsi kas'uwots gahbowtsi. <verse eid="HEB 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iya. 2:1-21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 6:22-25">6:22-25</ref> </char></note> Widetsu Ra'ab dats k'oroor amtswotsi jeenon b́ dek'tsosh azazerawwotsnton k'ironiyere b oor imnetiyone.<verse eid="HEB 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JDG 6:11-8:32">Mes. 6:11—8:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6-5:31">4:6—5:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:2-16:31">13:2—16:31</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:1-12:7">11:1—12:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 1:1-25:1">1 Sam. 1:1—25:1</ref></char>
    </note> Eshe k'osho aawne tkeewiti? Gediwon jangemo, Barak' jangemo, Samsom jangemó, Yoftahekemó, Daawitko, Samu'el jangemó, nebiyiyiwots jango t keewrawok'o gizeyo taash bk'awneti, <verse eid="HEB 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 6:1-27">Dan. 6:1-27</ref> </char></note> Bo bo imnetiyon mengstwotsi da'arnee, kááwonowere k'eezrnee, boosh jangiyetsonowere daatsrne, ééshwots nonónowere bo is'i. <verse eid="HEB 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DAN 3:1-30">Dan. 3:1-30</ref> </char></note> Tawi angonowere takrnee, shiki shashatsnowere keshernee, nef wototse kesht kup' wotomaants bo woneyi, kes'oonowere kup'wotsi woternee, kec'r da'af t'alati kes'i ashuwotsi bogishi, <verse eid="HEB 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:17-24">1 Naash. 17:17-24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:25-37">2 Naash. 4:25-37</ref> </char></note> Máátswots bo jag k'irtswotsi k'irotse botuure daats bodek'i. K'oshwotswere bogts k'irotse tuwo daatsosh gawt k'osh k'osh onó bobek'etwok'o k'alewor bo tipotse kesho geeratsne. <verse eid="HEB 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 22:26-27">1 Naash. 22:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:25-26">2 Zen. 18:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:2">Erm. 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:15">37:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 38:6">38:6</ref> </char></note> K'oshwotswere boats kashetswotsi wotat bojot'eyi, k'oshuwots bo tufo muk'on tpeyat tipi moots juweerne, <verse eid="HEB 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:37 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 24:21">2 Zen. 24:21</ref> </char></note> Shútson botogeyi, magaaziyon bo kap'eyi, shikon boúd'eyi, mereeronat eyishi gok'o tahdek't bo jawri, t'owwotsnat giishets ashuwotsi wotat bo shambi. <verse eid="HEB 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38"/>Worwotse, guratse, datsats gitsotse fa'a gop'onat oorotsa guurat bo beyi. Mank'owono datsu boosh wotiitk beyoko wotat daatseratsane.<verse eid="HEB 11:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39"/>Jamanotswere bo imntiyon boosh gawetso bowotiyaloru boosh jangiyetso daatsde'afa'ane. <verse eid="HEB 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40"/>Ik'o noosh k'ants keewo k'ani b́k'rtsotse, mansha bo nontoni bako boaal s'eenwotsi woto falatsne.<verse eid="HEB 11:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'o nonihi b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1"/>Daawnok'o noon gúúrts gaw jamanotsi no detstsotse no'ats kur wotts keew jamwotsi no'ats deshts morro k'a'úbayr no shinatse beyiru nohewo k'amde kup'ar woc'one. <verse eid="HEB 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2"/>Nowos'etwere no imnetiyo ned'itsonat s'eentstso Iyesus ats no ááwo gerdeniye, bíwere b́ shinatse need'wtsts geneúwatse tuutson jitatse k'irr gac'ewo eegok'oor b́ taawrawo jitatse gondbek'on k'iro k'amb́dek'i, Ik' be jooroke k'ano maants be b́wtsi.<verse eid="HEB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3"/>Eshe taahr, maac'o it k'ut'rawok'o morretswots bín bo k'eefere k'amdek'tso Iyesusi s'ilde'ere. <verse eid="HEB 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4"/>It morronton mak'orewoke s'ats kud'efetsosh b́borfetso k'eferafa'tee. <verse eid="HEB 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5"/>Ik'o b́ nana'ikok'o woshdek't itango kup'shosh hank'o bí ettso batk'rerte,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">«T naayo! doonzo sezo ketik'aye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:5">b́ hadoshowere maac'o k'ut'k'aye,<verse eid="HEB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:5-6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:11-12">Ari. 3:11-12</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzo b́ shuntsoniye b́ sezfoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:6">B́ nayik'owosh dekt b́s'iliruwono b́fayefoni.»<verse eid="HEB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7"/>Ik'o b́ nanaúwotsk'o itn b́tawtsotse b́ sezo k'amoore, b́ niho bín b́ sezraw na'o kone? <verse eid="HEB 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8"/>Nana'a wotts jamwots bo daatsiru sezo it were daatso it k'azal dik'al itna boko nana'a itnaliye. <verse eid="HEB 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9"/>Haniyere okoon, noúnetsi sezf meetsi nihwots detsfone b́teshi, bonowere mangiye nomangifoni, bere kashon beyosh kashi weeron nih wottsosh iki bogshde azazewo aawk'oneya noosh geyiwo b́k'azeti! <verse eid="HEB 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10"/>Bosh sheengo araat b́ be'etsok'on muk' gizewush noon sezrne, bímo b́ S'ayino kayitwotsi nowotish sheengosh noon sezfe. <verse eid="HEB 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11"/>Sez jamo manorish shiyanitka bako geneúshitk areratse, ilomo man dandek'ts ashuwotssh jeenon s'eentso kááw fini shwo boosh daatsituwe.<verse eid="HEB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Izonat bo atso korbodek'etuwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ISA 35:3">Isa. 35:3</ref> </char>
    </note> Mansh it kish neftswotsnat itgubr maawtswotsi kup'ide'ere. <verse eid="HEB 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 4:6">Ari. 4:6</ref> </char></note> Doklirwo b́ kashitwok'owa bako b́ beyoke keer b́ tisherawok'o, it tufooshowere weerindi kááwo woshde'ere.<verse eid="HEB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14"/>S'ayn woteraniye konworu doonzo bek'osh b́ falawotse, ash jamonton jeenon bewore, S'ayinon beyoshowere kup'owere, <verse eid="HEB 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 29:18">Iwi. 29:18</ref> </char></note> Ititsere konshoru Ik' s'aato b́ shaprawok'o it atso korde'ere, mank'owere s'aam shuu iko shuwit s'ap'o ititse boc'r iti b́ kic'irawok'o, aywotsno b́ kimshrawok'o korde'ere. <verse eid="HEB 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 25:29-34">Aze. 25:29-34</ref> </char></note> Gusiyetso wee iknoti móósha ett b́ took k'aabo kemtso Esawkok'o shayri ash woterawo ititsere b́ daatserawok'o it atso korde'ere. <verse eid="HEB 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 27:30-40">Aze. 27:30-40</ref> </char></note> Esaw il s'aato aaniy dek'osh b́ geyor s'aatman bísh baziyetsok'o danfte, b́k'altso woniyosh kup'dek't eepfetst b́geyiyalor weero daatso falratse.<verse eid="HEB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18"/>Kishon shuu'etwok wee mis'etuo Sin gurok borafa'ate, bamplomants, shatits t'alwots, eegurahi jongokowere, <verse eid="HEB 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 19:16-22">Kesh. 19:16-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:18-21">20:18-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:11">Iwi. 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:22-27">5:22-27</ref> </char></note> Ezbedi k'arokowere wee keeweyiru aap'o b́ shishetwoko borafa'ate, aap'ets keewman shishts ashuwots «Eshe bodre haniyak k'osho noosh aap'ek'aye» et bok'onfetso bodrnee.<verse eid="HEB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:12-13">Iwi. 19:12-13</ref> </char>
    </note> «Gizo dab gurman b́ t'awiyal</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="HEB 12:20">Shútson togeyar k'irwee»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 12:20">Etiru tzaziyo boats b́mangtsosh bín kuro falratsne. <verse eid="HEB 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 9:19">Iwi. 9:19</ref> </char></note> Manoke bek'ets keewman eenonat shatiik b́teshtsotse dab́ Muse woor</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:21">«Taa shataat, k'ewere» bí et.<verse eid="HEB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22"/>Itiyelee S'iyon guromants t'inwtsertee, bihe kashetso Ik'o kito wotts daritstsu Iyerusalemiye, genee'úwon kakwedek'tswotsok, ay kumon taawet mlakiwotsok t'inrte, <verse eid="HEB 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 4:10">Aze. 4:10</ref> </char></note> Bo shúútso darots guut'etswotsok, k'aab nana'a wotts amantsuwots ko'eetsok, kááw angshitu Izar izewerokonat s'ayin wotat daatsts shayirwotsok t'inrte.<verse eid="HEB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24"/>Handr taareyosh dag taalotse manik wottso Iyesusnat Abeel s'atsoniyere k'antso keewiru fakets s'atsookowere t'inrte.<verse eid="HEB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EXO 20:22">Kesh. 20:22</ref> </char>
    </note> Keewirman de'atsone it erawok'o itatso korde'ere, Ekeewots Ik'o ashon datsatse boosh b́ keewre k'ewatsone ettswots b́shirotse kesho bomaawiyakon, bére noo darotse noosh keewirwo dek'onok'azal awuk'o kalrniya b́ kishotse kesho nofaliti! <verse eid="HEB 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:26 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Hag. 2:6</ref> </char></note> Manoor bí aap'o datso shek'ere, «andmó datsu mec'ro b́woterawo aani dabr darono dabde'er shek'ituwe» eton keewure. <verse eid="HEB 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27"/>Han «Iknoto dabr,» etiru keewoniye b́ kitsiriyee shek'eraw keewwots kup'arr bobetuwok'o shek'eyirwots wee azeets keewwots bobeyoke botuwitok'oniye.<verse eid="HEB 12:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28"/>Eshe noo shek'eraw mengstu nonaatetwotse Ik'o udoonee, b́ gene'úwitwok'oon mangiyonat shatoon bísh finone. <verse eid="HEB 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 4:24">Iwi. 4:24</ref> </char></note> No Ik'o Izar Izewer mitsit tawok'oyiye.<verse eid="HEB 12:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13"/>
  <para style="s">Ik' geneúshit fino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1"/>Jam aawo it ats atsewo eshwi shunon shunewere, <verse eid="HEB 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-8">Aze. 18:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:1-3">19:1-3</ref> </char></note> Ibo de'er ibiyo batk'ayere, mank'oon ibuwotsi dek't ibiyoke ik ik ashuwots bodananiyere melakiwotsi dek't ibiyirne. <verse eid="HEB 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3"/>Bonton tohar it tipetsok'o woshder tipetswotsi gawwere, it were bokok'o gondo it bek'irwok'o woshder gond bek'irwotsi gawwere.<verse eid="HEB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4"/>De'ewo jamokere mangiyek wotowe, widetswotsnat gobetswotsats Ik'o b́ angshitwotse kenihonat máátsun amank woto shapiir bo de'ewo kimsh k'ayine.<verse eid="HEB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:6">Iwi. 31:6</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 31:8">8</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 1:5">Iya. 1:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Gizi shunatse wokoore, it detstso itsh boree, Ik'o «Taahe b́ jamon neen juweratse, b́ jamon neen k'ayaatse» etre. <verse eid="HEB 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 118:6">Dub. 118:6</ref> </char></note> Manshowere amande'er,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Taan tep'etwo doonzoniye, sharaatse,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Asho taan eeg k'alosheb́ faliti? No eteti.<verse eid="HEB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7"/>Ik' aap'o shin shino itsh keewts itn jishirwotsi batk'ayere, bo beyonat bo fini shuwo gawr bo imneti jafro sha'owere. <verse eid="HEB 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8"/>Iyesus Krstos ootsowere haambetsowere dúredúrosh bíne, wonawoneratse. <verse eid="HEB 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9"/>Daneraw k'osh k'osh naari danosh kisho imk'ayere, nonibo máá nemwotsi kotosh b́ woterawon s'aatats b́kup'ink'ere sheenge, mishi nem han shoyts ashuwots eegor boosh k'alratse.<verse eid="HEB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10"/>Noo wosh t'iintsef t'arap'ezo detsfone, b́ woteferor dunkaniwtse finef kahniwots wosh t'intseyiru t'ar'p'ezoke fa'a misho k'aaúde'er bomarawok'o baziyeke. <verse eid="HEB 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 16:27">Lew. 16:27</ref> </char></note> Manwere eegoshe ayhudiyi kahniwotsats naashi k'aabo morrosh oorowe eto datseetwo gizi s'atso de'er jam beyokoniyere bog S'aynts beyokuk b́ kinditi, gizi dunmanó gáloniyere úratsne b́ mis'eti. <verse eid="HEB 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12"/>Mank'owere Iyesus ash asho b́ took s'atson S'ayntsosh kiti fengeshoniyere úratse gondo bek'o b́dek'i. <verse eid="HEB 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13"/>Noowere gálotse keer b́ maants amone, b́ ketts ketonowere kaydek'tswotsi wotoone. <verse eid="HEB 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14"/>Noo haniyak weet kituni nokotiri bako kup'ar need'it kitu datsanatse deshatsone. <verse eid="HEB 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15"/>Haniyako Iyesusn udi wosho uniaawo Ik'osh t'intswonee, hanwere b́ shútsosh gawiru nooni k'indwotsn t'iinet udi woshoniye. <verse eid="HEB 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16"/>Sheeng keewo k'alonat it detsts keewo jamwotssh kayiyo batk'ayere, Ik'o geneúshitwoniye hank'o wotts woshoniye.<verse eid="HEB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17"/>Itn jishirwotssh alewere, bo ali shirots wotoore, boon aatet keewo (halafinet) b́beyrwotse it kashi jangosh kup'at bofiiniri, it boosh it azazeyink'ere bo bofino genee'úwon finiyank'nee, mank'o wotob́k'azalmó bo fino shiyanone bofinti, manwere itsh k'auntsalko b́ wotiti.<verse eid="HEB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18"/>Noosh Ik'o k'onwore, nib s'ayino nodetstsok'o arikee, jam weeron sheeng doyonon beyosh tewnirwone.<verse eid="HEB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19"/>Dabnwor kup'arr Ik'o itk'onitwok'oye itn kup'idek'at tk'oniri itok tiaanitwok'oye.<verse eid="HEB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gúúpi Ik' k'ono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20"/>Mererwotsi jintso nodoonz Iyesusi dúre dúri taareyi s'atson k'irotse tuuztso Ik'o Izar Izewer jeenika <verse eid="HEB 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21"/>B́ shuntso k'alosh it bodetwok'o sheeng keew jamon itn editwee, geneúshitwonowere Iyesus Krstos weeron noon woshwe. Iyesus Krstossh dúre dúron mango wotowe, amen.<verse eid="HEB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gúúpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22"/>Ti eshwotso, itsh t guut'ts wosho k'awun b́ wottsosh ti izts keewan k'amde'er itdek'etwok'owe ayidek'at itn tk'oniri. <verse eid="HEB 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23"/>No eshu T'imotiwos tipi mootse b́ keshtsok'o it danetwok'o shunfee, kááwon han maants b́ weetka wotiyal bínton it maants waar iti s'iiletwe.<verse eid="HEB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24"/>Iti jishirwotsnat S'ayin jamwotssh t jamo t'intswere, It'aaliyani datson waat hanoke fa'a krstiyanwots jamo itsh t'iintsrnee.<verse eid="HEB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25"/>S'aato it jametsnton wotowe. Amen!<verse eid="HEB 13:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13"/>
</usx>
